{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026knu1Vl7XXK1794492962.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能AI晶片商輝達行政總裁黃仁勳，爆出婚外情醜聞後，輝達宣布黃仁勳已請辭。</p><p></p><p>輝達自1993年創立以來，一直由黃仁勳領導。在他接連爆出醜聞後，輝達董事會開會討論他的去留，當地周四宣布，黃仁勳辭去總裁、行政總裁及董事會成員職務，即時生效。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.HUANG-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262IrglZTHPU1794493028.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現任執行副總裁兼首席財務官克雷斯，同意擔任臨時行政總裁，直至任命正式繼任人，董事會亦已啟動正式行政總裁遴選工作，並將考慮內部和外部候選人。</p><p></p><p>《華盛頓郵報》早前引述知情人士說，白宮不會介入輝達董事會決策。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:04:07.281471+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:28.740577+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:57:31.426994+00:00","content_hash":"64e149c6a08893ef786f98853a8df054294072021e5acccba7812c1a61fcefc9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:04:07.281471+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}